            "goal": "Evaluate agents without touching real systems.",
            "opener": "How do you evaluate an agent that issues refunds, without refunding anyone?",
            "evidence": {
              "strong": "Sandboxed copies or mocks of tools and data, simulated users, outcome checks in the sandbox (correct refund, nothing unauthorised), trajectory checks (right tools, valid arguments, no forbidden actions, reasonable steps and cost), repeated runs and resettable environments.",
