              "Which slices have zero tolerance?",
              "Who can override a failing gate?"
            ],
            "hints": [
              "Averages hide regressions.",
              "Make the failure visible where people work."
            ],
            "referenceFix": "CI suites on every relevant change, per-slice and cost and latency gates, reports in pull requests, approved overrides, then canaries."
