              "strong": "Estimates calls per run (cases times trials times system plus judge calls), budgets per team, smaller quick suites on every commit and full suites before release, caching outputs for unchanged configurations, cheaper judges where calibrated, concurrency limits to respect provider rate limits, and off-peak scheduling.",
